msgctxt "name"
msgid "Send to TV"
msgstr "An Fernseher senden"

#. Shown in the add-ons manager, at most 132 characters
msgctxt "description"
msgid "Plays YouTube videos on the TV the phone casts to: hold a video link or tap the button in the address bar."
msgstr "Spielt YouTube-Videos auf dem Fernseher ab, zu dem das Telefon streamt: Videolink halten oder Knopf in der Adressleiste antippen."

#. Context menu entry and address bar button
msgctxt "playOnTv"
msgid "Play on TV"
msgstr "Auf Fernseher abspielen"

#. $1 is the name of the TV
msgctxt "playOn"
msgid "Play on “$1”"
msgstr "Auf „$1“ abspielen"

#. Context menu entry, greyed out
msgctxt "notConnected"
msgid "Play on TV – no TV connected"
msgstr "Auf Fernseher abspielen – kein Fernseher verbunden"

#. $1 is the name of the TV
msgctxt "noLinks"
msgid "“$1” cannot play links"
msgstr "„$1“ kann keine Links abspielen"

#. Notification; $1 is the name of the TV
msgctxt "playing"
msgid "Playing on “$1”."
msgstr "Läuft auf „$1“."

#. Notification; $1 is the name of the TV
msgctxt "starting"
msgid "Starting on “$1”…"
msgstr "Startet auf „$1“…"

#. Notification; $1 is the name of the TV. Cast is the quick setting of Phosh, named as there
msgctxt "code"
msgid "“$1” shows a code: enter it in the Cast quick setting."
msgstr "„$1“ zeigt einen Code: in der Schnelleinstellung Streaming eingeben."

#. Notification. Cast is the quick setting of Phosh, named as there
msgctxt "noTv"
msgid "No TV is connected. Connect one in the Cast quick setting first."
msgstr "Kein Fernseher verbunden. Zuerst in der Schnelleinstellung Streaming einen verbinden."

#. Notification
msgctxt "notAVideo"
msgid "This is not a link to a YouTube video."
msgstr "Das ist kein Link zu einem YouTube-Video."

#. Notification; $1 is the reason Schwupp gives
msgctxt "failed"
msgid "The TV could not play it: $1"
msgstr "Der Fernseher konnte es nicht abspielen: $1"

#. Reason when Schwupp gives none
msgctxt "unknownError"
msgid "unknown error"
msgstr "unbekannter Fehler"

#. Notification
msgctxt "noHost"
msgid "Send to TV cannot reach Schwupp: the package plinius-send-to-tv is missing."
msgstr "„An Fernseher senden“ erreicht Schwupp nicht: Das Paket plinius-send-to-tv fehlt."

#. Stands for the TV's name when Schwupp has none
msgctxt "theTv"
msgid "TV"
msgstr "Fernseher"
